Spec: Countdown

Purpose:
  The pre-ride countdown between Home and the ride screen.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  ./widgets/*.dart
  /test/timer

References:
  /docs/specs/history/11-timer.md
  /docs/specs/history/21-countdown-cue.md
  /lib/domain/countdown_cue.sdd

Must:
  The countdown runs `10` s; +5 sec. restarts it from the current value plus five.
  At zero, or on Start now, it opens the ride screen once.
  The ring is proportional to the highest value seen in this run.
  The GPS row shows the live signal: ready, searching or switched off.
  The voice cue counts `5` to `1` and says the start when the ride starts; leaving cuts a phrase still spoken.
  The screen uses a fixed dark palette built from existing tokens.

Must not:
  Start recording; recording starts on the ride screen.
